{
  "body" : "You are designing a dramatic coastal scene captured during golden hour, emphasizing dynamic silhouettes and vivid natural lighting.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Scene description: {{scene}}\n- Primary subject: {{subject}}\n- Copy: {{copy}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: Cinematic coastal photography\n- Composition: Rule-of-thirds framing, strong subject silhouette against expansive sky and sea, medium-wide shot with balanced foreground and background\n- Lens / camera: Wide-angle lens (~24mm), moderate depth of field, slight fisheye distortion for dramatic perspective\n- Lighting: Golden hour backlighting, with warm sunlight piercing through, creating striking highlights and soft shadows\n- Color palette and grading: Vibrant teal and warm gold hues, high contrast, slightly desaturated shadows\n- Texture / surface: Crisp details in foreground textures, smooth gradient in sky\n- Post-processing: Slight lens flare, soft glow around light source, minimal halation\n- Mood: Serene, dramatic, expansive\n- References: Inspired by Kodak Ektachrome color profile, cinematic coastal scenes, and dynamic silhouette photography\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 3:2 landscape (~1536×1024) suitable for hero banner placement\n- Maintain a clear silhouette of the subject against the bright horizon\n- Ensure the natural elements (sky, sea, rocks) feel expansive and immersive\n\nAVOID\n- Overly saturated colors\n- Busy or cluttered foregrounds that compete with the subject\n- Harsh artificial lighting\n- Flat compositions lacking depth and contrast\n- Distracting elements breaking the serene coastal mood\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nScene description: {{scene}}\nPrimary subject: {{subject}}\nCopy: {{copy}}\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}",
